  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol Daawitin Ajjeesuuf Yaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol ilma isaa Yoonaataanii fi tajaajiltoota hunda akka isaan Daawitin ajjeesan ajaje. Yoonaataan garuu akka malee Daawitin jaallata ture;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedhees isa akeekkachiise; \"Saaʼol abbaan koo karaa ittiin si ajjeesu barbaadachaa jira. Bori ganama of eeggadhu; dhokadhuutii achuma turi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anis gad baʼee abbaa koo wajjin dirree ati jirtu irra nan dhaabadha. Waaʼee kees isa wajjin haasaʼee waan inni jedhe sitti hima.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoonaataanis akkana jedhee abbaa isaa Saaʼolitti waaʼee Daawit waan gaarii dubbate; \"Mootichi tajaajilaa isaa Daawititti yakka hin hojjetin; inni homaa si hin goone; wanni inni hojjetes faayidaa guddaa siif argamsiiseera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daawit lubbuu ofii isaatiif yaaduu dhiisee Filisxeemicha ajjeese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israaʼel hundaaf moʼannaa guddaa kenne; atis waan kana argitee gammaddeerta. Yoos ati maaliif sababii malee isa ajjeesuudhaan nama yakka hin qabne kan akka Daawititti yakka hojjetta ree?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼolis Yoonaataanin dhaggeeffatee, \"Dhugaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jiraataa, Daawit hin ajjeefamu\" jedhee kakate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Yoonaataan Daawitin waamee waan kana hunda itti hime. Saaʼolittis isa fide; Daawitis akkuma duriitti Saaʼol dura dhaabate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammas lolli ni kaʼe; Daawitis dhaqee Filisxeemota lole. Innis humna guddaan isaan dhaʼe; isaanis isa duraa baqatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garuu utuu Saaʼol eeboo harkatti qabatee mana isaa taaʼuu hafuuri hamaan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "biraa isatti dhufe. Utuu Daawit baganaa taphachaa jiruu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol eeboodhaan Daawitin keenyanitti hodhuu yaale; Daawit garuu duraa miliqe; Saaʼolis eeboo sana keenyanitti fixe. Daawitis halkan sana baqatee jalaa baʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol akka isaan eeganii ganamaan isa ajjeesaniif mana Daawititti namoota erge. Miikaal niitiin Daawit garuu, \"Ati yoo halkan kana baqachuu baatte bori ni ajjeefamta\" jettee akeekkachiifte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Miikaal foddaa keessaan Daawitin gad buufte; innis baqatee miliqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasii Miikaal fakkii Waaqa tolfamaa tokko fuutee wayyaa itti uffiftee siree irra ciibsite; boraatii rifeensa reʼees mataa jala keesseef.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo Saaʼol Daawitin qabsiisuuf namoota ergetti Miikaal, \"Inni dhukkubsateera\" jette.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol akka isaan Daawitin ilaalaniif deebisee namoota ergee, \"Akka ani isa ajjeesuuf siree isaatiin naa fidaa\" isaaniin jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo namoonni sun ol seenanitti fakkiin Waaqa tolfamaa sun siree irra ciibsamee, rifeensi reʼees mataa jala kaaʼameefii argame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼolis Miikaaliin, \"Ati maaliif akka diinni koo miliquuf akkas na gowwoomsite?\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 19:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miikaalis, \"Isatu, 'Jalaa na miliqsi; yoo kanaa achii ani sin ajjeesaa' naan jedhe\" jetteen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daawitis yeroo baqatee miliqetti Saamuʼeel bira Raamaa dhaqee waan Saaʼol isa godhe hunda itti hime. Ergasiis innii fi Saamuʼeel gara Naayot dhaqanii achuma turan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼolittis, \"Kunoo Daawit Naayot ishee Raamaa keessatti argamtu keessa jira\" jedhanii himan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu inni akka isa qabaniif namoota itti erge. Isaan garuu yeroo garee raajota raajii dubbatanii kan Saamuʼeel hoogganaa isaanii taʼee achi dhaabachaa ture tokko arganitti Hafuurri Waaqaa namoota Saaʼol irra buʼee isaanis akkasuma raajii dubbatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaʼol yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti namoota biraa erge; isaanis akkasuma raajii dubbatan. Saaʼol ammas yeroo sadaffaaf namoota erge; isaanis akkasuma raajii dubbatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhuma irratti inni ofuma isaatii kaʼee Raamaa dhaqe; boolla bishaanii guddaa Seekuutti argamu bira gaʼee, \"Saamuʼeelii fi Daawit eessa jiru?\" jedhee gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 19:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Namni tokkos, \"Isaan Naayot ishee Raamaa keessa jirtu keessa jiru\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Saaʼol gara Naayot ishee Raamaa keessa jirtu sanaa dhaqe. Garuu Hafuurri Waaqaa isaa irra buʼe; innis hamma Nawaat gaʼutti raajii dubbachaa deeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayyaa isaas of irraa baasee fuula Saamuʼeel duratti raajii dubbate. Innis halkanii fi guyyaa sana guutuu qullaa isaa ciise. Sababiin namoonni, \"Saaʼolis raajota keessaa tokkoodhaa?\" jedhaniif kanuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.20",
